(4557002, 656812, 26001, '<td valign="top">This is probably the best camera work i have seen involving nothing but a plastic bag. thinking of it, second best...after the scene from "American Beauty" movie. a little more negative space could have helped the shot btw. still i like this one a lot.</td>', 'This is probably the best camera work i have seen involving nothing but a plastic bag. thinking of it, second best...after the scene from "American Beauty" movie. a little more negative space could have helped the shot btw. still i like this one a lot.', '2008-03-12 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4557006, 655098, 26001, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful. very nice exposure and minimalistic composition. the only thing i could think of improving is saturation. you could have saturated and deepen those beautiful blues for increased impact. even the horizon curvature adds a lot to the image. very nice work.</td>', 'absolutely beautiful. very nice exposure and minimalistic composition. the only thing i could think of improving is saturation. you could have saturated and deepen those beautiful blues for increased impact. even the horizon curvature adds a lot to the image. very nice work.', '2008-03-12 03:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4557094, 655459, 54778, '<td valign="top">I think you should have been closer to the subject because the leaves take away the attention because they seem to be getting most of the flash.. other then that maybe you could have more to the left because the road seems it could have been used more as a backdrop because leading lines are often considered more interesting..</td>', 'I think you should have been closer to the subject because the leaves take away the attention because they seem to be getting most of the flash.. other then that maybe you could have more to the left because the road seems it could have been used more as a backdrop because leading lines are often considered more interesting..', '2008-03-12 05:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4557096, 656423, 54778, '<td valign="top">Nice image. like how the red pops out and the reflections..</td>', 'Nice image. like how the red pops out and the reflections..', '2008-03-12 05:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4557104, 656909, 54778, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but maybe cropping it the slightest bit more[like keeping a quarter of the ashtray and more negative space in the image]the use of b/w is an interestind idea..  Maybe the light should have been gentler so the cigarette wasn''t so blown out by it..</td>', 'I like the composition but maybe cropping it the slightest bit more[like keeping a quarter of the ashtray and more negative space in the image]the use of b/w is an interestind idea..  Maybe the light should have been gentler so the cigarette wasn''t so blown out by it..', '2008-03-12 05:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4557105, 654998, 54778, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours and span of the image but maybe there isn''t enough of a focal point</td>', 'I really like the colours and span of the image but maybe there isn''t enough of a focal point', '2008-03-12 05:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4557109, 656810, 54778, '<td valign="top">Nice soft colours and lighting but I think the framing should have been with the fisher man more to the right [and more light. He''s just not very obvious in that darkened corner] and I find the connection between pollution and just the one man slightly vague.. maybe it''s rigs [behind the man] that you''re alluding to. I''m not sure..</td>', 'Nice soft colours and lighting but I think the framing should have been with the fisher man more to the right [and more light. He''s just not very obvious in that darkened corner] and I find the connection between pollution and just the one man slightly vague.. maybe it''s rigs [behind the man] that you''re alluding to. I''m not sure..', '2008-03-12 05:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4557111, 656862, 54778, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.. Really like the glow of the sky and the streamlined smoke trail. but maybe it would have been more interesting composition if you had been closer and the image had been using the longness of the building.</td>', 'Interesting image.. Really like the glow of the sky and the streamlined smoke trail. but maybe it would have been more interesting composition if you had been closer and the image had been using the longness of the building.', '2008-03-12 06:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
