(4557114, 655385, 54778, '<td valign="top">Very cool find and interesting colours, composition.. The only thing that lets it down is the lighting. The whole image seems to be overexposed and too bright losing quite a bit of the details..</td>', 'Very cool find and interesting colours, composition.. The only thing that lets it down is the lighting. The whole image seems to be overexposed and too bright losing quite a bit of the details..', '2008-03-12 06:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4557123, 655963, 54778, '<td valign="top">I really wish you''d kept the dancers out of the image because the light itself would have been more interesting and the dancers seem to red and underexposed and don''t add more to the composition..</td>', 'I really wish you''d kept the dancers out of the image because the light itself would have been more interesting and the dancers seem to red and underexposed and don''t add more to the composition..', '2008-03-12 06:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
