(4559831, 656098, 66784, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! The composition, the colours, the posing, the processing. Perfect!</td>', 'Fantastic! The composition, the colours, the posing, the processing. Perfect!', '2008-03-12 21:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559833, 656274, 89623, '<td valign="top">ew! this is a bit graphic.. try a virtical shot next tiem</td>', 'ew! this is a bit graphic.. try a virtical shot next tiem', '2008-03-12 21:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559835, 657041, 66784, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a lower viewpoint closer to the foreground interest would have worked better.</td>', 'Perhaps a lower viewpoint closer to the foreground interest would have worked better.', '2008-03-12 21:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559845, 656405, 66784, '<td valign="top">Vey nice subtle colours and tones</td>', 'Vey nice subtle colours and tones', '2008-03-12 21:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560231, 656295, 81301, '<td valign="top">Beautiful views from 10 Amsterdam ave!<br/>if I had known when you are taking the shot, I would have stood on my roof waiving at youº ¡K lovely photo, a bit of a stretch regarding ¡§pollution¡¨ nonetheless a very good shot. Good luck in this contest.</td>', 'Beautiful views from 10 Amsterdam ave!if I had known when you are taking the shot, I would have stood on my roof waiving at youº ¡K lovely photo, a bit of a stretch regarding ¡§pollution¡¨ nonetheless a very good shot. Good luck in this contest.', '2008-03-12 23:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560277, 656223, 22459, '<td valign="top">Polluting the waterways? I like the capture of the bird in flight just wish that boat top left wasn''t in it.</td>', 'Polluting the waterways? I like the capture of the bird in flight just wish that boat top left wasn''t in it.', '2008-03-12 23:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560280, 657040, 22459, '<td valign="top">Shows pollution well but the bird is a little over-exposed and central for my liking.</td>', 'Shows pollution well but the bird is a little over-exposed and central for my liking.', '2008-03-12 23:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560284, 656496, 22459, '<td valign="top">The B/W works well but the image is let down with those wires going across it.</td>', 'The B/W works well but the image is let down with those wires going across it.', '2008-03-12 23:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560293, 657068, 91282, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the vivid colors in this. (Though I often consider graffiti as more of an art than pollution.)</td>', 'Wow, I love the vivid colors in this. (Though I often consider graffiti as more of an art than pollution.)', '2008-03-12 23:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560294, 657099, 22459, '<td valign="top">Shows pollution well with all that rubbish tipped over but I think you may need a little curves/levels adjustment.</td>', 'Shows pollution well with all that rubbish tipped over but I think you may need a little curves/levels adjustment.', '2008-03-12 23:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560301, 655387, 22459, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge but for really good long exposures you need to have the buildings sharp as possible, these are a little soft.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge but for really good long exposures you need to have the buildings sharp as possible, these are a little soft.', '2008-03-12 23:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560311, 656999, 22459, '<td valign="top">High impact image with great tones and color. Without the title I would struggle to see pollution and still with it I see something beautiful not pollution......so I guess visual pollution can be very subjective. <br/>Still a great image but I would have probably saved it for the free-study.</td>', 'High impact image with great tones and color. Without the title I would struggle to see pollution and still with it I see something beautiful not pollution......so I guess visual pollution can be very subjective. Still a great image but I would have probably saved it for the free-study.', '2008-03-12 23:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560314, 657006, 22459, '<td valign="top">Lots of smog,steam and pollution but not much else to give the image impact, definately meets the challenge.</td>', 'Lots of smog,steam and pollution but not much else to give the image impact, definately meets the challenge.', '2008-03-12 23:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560319, 656264, 22459, '<td valign="top">I like seeing these brilliant white clouds of steam/smoke against the vived blue sky, well done.</td>', 'I like seeing these brilliant white clouds of steam/smoke against the vived blue sky, well done.', '2008-03-12 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560335, 656484, 22459, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the image itself suits the challenge but I don''t like the B/W conversion just a bit dull for my liking.</td>', 'I like the composition and the image itself suits the challenge but I don''t like the B/W conversion just a bit dull for my liking.', '2008-03-12 23:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560338, 656125, 22459, '<td valign="top">A pile of rubbish. Now that''s gotta be pollution.Sharp image but plain just not interesting enough.</td>', 'A pile of rubbish. Now that''s gotta be pollution.Sharp image but plain just not interesting enough.', '2008-03-12 23:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560339, 655778, 22459, '<td valign="top">Road kill!! The black and white conversion could have a bit more contrast for my liking.</td>', 'Road kill!! The black and white conversion could have a bit more contrast for my liking.', '2008-03-12 23:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560362, 656909, 22459, '<td valign="top">Pollution of the body,and the air we breath and pollution of the waterways with the butts, I hate these things, can you tell that I''m a reformed smoker. <br/> <br/>Nice b/w image love the sharp detail even if it''s not a pretty site, well done for this challenge.</td>', 'Pollution of the body,and the air we breath and pollution of the waterways with the butts, I hate these things, can you tell that I''m a reformed smoker.  Nice b/w image love the sharp detail even if it''s not a pretty site, well done for this challenge.', '2008-03-12 23:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560367, 656862, 22459, '<td valign="top">Great long exposure image, beautiful colors and unique softness but still tack sharp.</td>', 'Great long exposure image, beautiful colors and unique softness but still tack sharp.', '2008-03-12 23:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560369, 656402, 22459, '<td valign="top">Different take on the challenge but I like it, well done.</td>', 'Different take on the challenge but I like it, well done.', '2008-03-12 23:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560385, 655933, 90495, '<td valign="top">It''s more like recycling.</td>', 'It''s more like recycling.', '2008-03-13 00:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560388, 656098, 67237, '<td valign="top">excellent idea</td>', 'excellent idea', '2008-03-13 00:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560456, 655385, 22459, '<td valign="top">Recycling is a good way to avoid pollution, nice colors in this one.</td>', 'Recycling is a good way to avoid pollution, nice colors in this one.', '2008-03-13 01:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560457, 655312, 83805, '<td valign="top">nice separation.  the dof was utilized well too</td>', 'nice separation.  the dof was utilized well too', '2008-03-13 01:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560463, 656098, 22459, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image, but it must be late I''m having trouble "getting" this one. I''ll come back to it.</td>', 'Nice sharp image, but it must be late I''m having trouble "getting" this one. I''ll come back to it.', '2008-03-13 01:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560484, 656347, 83805, '<td valign="top">I would have adjusted the angle a little so that the house was a little straighter in the frame</td>', 'I would have adjusted the angle a little so that the house was a little straighter in the frame', '2008-03-13 01:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560527, 656987, 90394, '<td valign="top">Very inventive - that''s a light bulb right? I would love to have seen the original effect and colors. Maybe I''m asking too much, since I don''t know exactly in what manner you broke the bulb - but the motion blur on the bottom is distracting, and kept this otherwise original submission from a 9, or possibly a 10, if it had another color element. I give this an 8. Great idea! (no pun intended)</td>', 'Very inventive - that''s a light bulb right? I would love to have seen the original effect and colors. Maybe I''m asking too much, since I don''t know exactly in what manner you broke the bulb - but the motion blur on the bottom is distracting, and kept this otherwise original submission from a 9, or possibly a 10, if it had another color element. I give this an 8. Great idea! (no pun intended)', '2008-03-13 02:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560564, 656666, 22459, '<td valign="top">How true it is, Rock and Roll ain''t no noise pollution, Love AC/DC good take on the challenge.</td>', 'How true it is, Rock and Roll ain''t no noise pollution, Love AC/DC good take on the challenge.', '2008-03-13 02:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560656, 656496, 90777, '<td valign="top">A great idea, I like the power of the B&amp;W but the power lines are little distracting unfortunatley.</td>', 'A great idea, I like the power of the B&W but the power lines are little distracting unfortunatley.', '2008-03-13 05:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560658, 656125, 90777, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the litter in context i.e. is there a nice beach/parkland just out of the frame?</td>', 'Would like to see the litter in context i.e. is there a nice beach/parkland just out of the frame?', '2008-03-13 05:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560661, 656991, 90777, '<td valign="top">Good use of DoF to draw attention to the subject</td>', 'Good use of DoF to draw attention to the subject', '2008-03-13 05:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560666, 657041, 90777, '<td valign="top">I had to search a little for the litter, perhaps if the tyre was more prominent in the frame.</td>', 'I had to search a little for the litter, perhaps if the tyre was more prominent in the frame.', '2008-03-13 05:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560667, 654868, 90777, '<td valign="top">Good framing compostition and use of the roof angle.</td>', 'Good framing compostition and use of the roof angle.', '2008-03-13 05:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560668, 656223, 90777, '<td valign="top">Good timing, although the boat hull in the top left is unfortunate though</td>', 'Good timing, although the boat hull in the top left is unfortunate though', '2008-03-13 05:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560670, 657066, 90777, '<td valign="top">A great idea.  Possibly a little oversharpened, (halo around top of truck and his right thumb)?</td>', 'A great idea.  Possibly a little oversharpened, (halo around top of truck and his right thumb)?', '2008-03-13 05:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560673, 656561, 90777, '<td valign="top">The plain sky is a little boring and the scaffold in the bottom left could have been cropped out.</td>', 'The plain sky is a little boring and the scaffold in the bottom left could have been cropped out.', '2008-03-13 05:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
