(4562738, 655424, 75386, '<td valign="top">well heres the best so far.<br/>very powerful image showing pollution, its affect on nature, and even more important its affect on people. (maybe not directly on people, but as a byproduct of the industrial age)</td>', 'well heres the best so far.very powerful image showing pollution, its affect on nature, and even more important its affect on people. (maybe not directly on people, but as a byproduct of the industrial age)', '2008-03-13 21:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562808, 655678, 90806, '<td valign="top">The sunset and water are beautiful, so pretty I find it takes a bit to focus on anything that feels polluted.  I am torn as it is a beautiful photo, but not knowing the context doesn''t seem all that polluted.</td>', 'The sunset and water are beautiful, so pretty I find it takes a bit to focus on anything that feels polluted.  I am torn as it is a beautiful photo, but not knowing the context doesn''t seem all that polluted.', '2008-03-13 22:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562810, 655983, 90806, '<td valign="top">Natural and easily degraded?</td>', 'Natural and easily degraded?', '2008-03-13 22:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562816, 657027, 90806, '<td valign="top">The coloration, clouds and fog strongly imply pollution, real or not.</td>', 'The coloration, clouds and fog strongly imply pollution, real or not.', '2008-03-13 22:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562821, 656405, 90806, '<td valign="top">Awfully clear and sharp for the title, would have expected more haze.</td>', 'Awfully clear and sharp for the title, would have expected more haze.', '2008-03-13 22:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562826, 655676, 90806, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color in the flames and polluted on ground and air.</td>', 'Beautiful color in the flames and polluted on ground and air.', '2008-03-13 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562828, 655387, 90806, '<td valign="top">The stacks emitting the central plumes that draw the eye seem a bit fuzzy, perhaps a bit soft all around, though striking.</td>', 'The stacks emitting the central plumes that draw the eye seem a bit fuzzy, perhaps a bit soft all around, though striking.', '2008-03-13 22:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562833, 656402, 90806, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is.  The title is the only part that implies pollution as the pristinely shiny bubbles don''t hint at why they are unclean.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is.  The title is the only part that implies pollution as the pristinely shiny bubbles don''t hint at why they are unclean.', '2008-03-13 22:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562837, 655260, 90806, '<td valign="top">Striking</td>', 'Striking', '2008-03-13 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562838, 656423, 90806, '<td valign="top">Classic indeed.</td>', 'Classic indeed.', '2008-03-13 22:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562840, 656111, 90806, '<td valign="top">I can hear the hum just looking at it</td>', 'I can hear the hum just looking at it', '2008-03-13 22:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562842, 656334, 51750, '<td valign="top">I think this might''ve worked better if it were vertical so the leg isn''t chopped off and the other about to go out of frame. Also i think she is somewhat out of place in this photo for the challenge. I really like the lighting and the post production; the tones are really nice and the lighting shows off the legs curves nicely.<br/>I would love to see more of your work, pm me your profile or portfolio or something if you would. I''m not voting just so you know.</td>', 'I think this might''ve worked better if it were vertical so the leg isn''t chopped off and the other about to go out of frame. Also i think she is somewhat out of place in this photo for the challenge. I really like the lighting and the post production; the tones are really nice and the lighting shows off the legs curves nicely.I would love to see more of your work, pm me your profile or portfolio or something if you would. I''m not voting just so you know.', '2008-03-13 22:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562843, 656587, 90806, '<td valign="top">Excellent title to set the mood.  Not much to show that it is actively polluting, but the colors really set the mood.</td>', 'Excellent title to set the mood.  Not much to show that it is actively polluting, but the colors really set the mood.', '2008-03-13 22:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562846, 655609, 90806, '<td valign="top">I find the bright orange in the left sky distracting.  Perhaps framing only the right two or only the rightmost cluster would have been more effective.  The downward sloping at the bottom left also seems to pull my eye in an odd direction.</td>', 'I find the bright orange in the left sky distracting.  Perhaps framing only the right two or only the rightmost cluster would have been more effective.  The downward sloping at the bottom left also seems to pull my eye in an odd direction.', '2008-03-13 22:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562848, 657066, 90806, '<td valign="top">The details of the truck seem rather washed out, but an interesting idea and thought to ponder.</td>', 'The details of the truck seem rather washed out, but an interesting idea and thought to ponder.', '2008-03-13 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562849, 655459, 90806, '<td valign="top">Curbside pickup?</td>', 'Curbside pickup?', '2008-03-13 22:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562850, 656901, 90806, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit better title to clarify how this is pollution.  Seems quite oversharpened.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit better title to clarify how this is pollution.  Seems quite oversharpened.', '2008-03-13 22:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562854, 656842, 90806, '<td valign="top">Bright and beautiful though I might have cropped in another quarter of the frame from the left and brought the top down some.</td>', 'Bright and beautiful though I might have cropped in another quarter of the frame from the left and brought the top down some.', '2008-03-13 22:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562857, 655394, 90806, '<td valign="top">Maybe they''ll come back to get it ;)  Excellent</td>', 'Maybe they''ll come back to get it ;)  Excellent', '2008-03-13 22:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562860, 657039, 90806, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy for me.  I like the title, subject and composition very well though.</td>', 'A bit grainy for me.  I like the title, subject and composition very well though.', '2008-03-13 22:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562863, 656267, 90806, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel polluted to me and I don''t see obvious evidence in the photo.</td>', 'Doesn''t feel polluted to me and I don''t see obvious evidence in the photo.', '2008-03-13 22:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562867, 656987, 59415, '<td valign="top">Great smoke image.</td>', 'Great smoke image.', '2008-03-13 22:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562868, 656336, 59415, '<td valign="top">This would really make a great horror movie.</td>', 'This would really make a great horror movie.', '2008-03-13 22:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562870, 655676, 59415, '<td valign="top">Did you have a permit for that fire?</td>', 'Did you have a permit for that fire?', '2008-03-13 22:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562871, 656796, 90806, '<td valign="top">Definitely polluted.  I find my eye seeking more detail, something to focus on.</td>', 'Definitely polluted.  I find my eye seeking more detail, something to focus on.', '2008-03-13 22:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562873, 657041, 59415, '<td valign="top">Ah, the old tire in the bay trick.  I wish there were no tree leaves on the right side, and something about the tone adjustments seems a little off to me.  But then again what do I know?  lol</td>', 'Ah, the old tire in the bay trick.  I wish there were no tree leaves on the right side, and something about the tone adjustments seems a little off to me.  But then again what do I know?  lol', '2008-03-13 22:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562874, 657006, 90806, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy.  I would like to either see more of the dark foreground if it is important or have it gone so it doesn''t distract.</td>', 'A bit grainy.  I would like to either see more of the dark foreground if it is important or have it gone so it doesn''t distract.', '2008-03-13 22:43:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4562875, 656317, 59415, '<td valign="top">Habitat.  Excellent.  See not all pollution is bad.  Frogs need a home too.</td>', 'Habitat.  Excellent.  See not all pollution is bad.  Frogs need a home too.', '2008-03-13 22:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562877, 655462, 59415, '<td valign="top">This gets a 10 because I am so freakin tired of all the lights.  Pardon my language.</td>', 'This gets a 10 because I am so freakin tired of all the lights.  Pardon my language.', '2008-03-13 22:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562879, 655098, 90806, '<td valign="top">The irony to me is that this is a nice clean piece of glass that was made from sand and will essentially return to it as it is ground up.  I like the light effect in the shadow, but the curved blurry horizon doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'The irony to me is that this is a nice clean piece of glass that was made from sand and will essentially return to it as it is ground up.  I like the light effect in the shadow, but the curved blurry horizon doesn''t do much for me.', '2008-03-13 22:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562881, 654868, 90806, '<td valign="top">Other than the title and name of the challenge, that could just be a poofy white cloud behind part of a building.</td>', 'Other than the title and name of the challenge, that could just be a poofy white cloud behind part of a building.', '2008-03-13 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562883, 657034, 59415, '<td valign="top">And Lord, we are especially thankful for nuclear power, the cleanest, safest energy source there is. Except for solar, which is just a pipe dream.<br/> <br/>-Homer Simpson-</td>', 'And Lord, we are especially thankful for nuclear power, the cleanest, safest energy source there is. Except for solar, which is just a pipe dream. -Homer Simpson-', '2008-03-13 22:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562884, 657057, 90806, '<td valign="top">I see potential for pollution, but perhaps it is cleanly run and managed?  Can''t tell from the photo.</td>', 'I see potential for pollution, but perhaps it is cleanly run and managed?  Can''t tell from the photo.', '2008-03-13 22:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562885, 656957, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think roads are ugly too.  Ugly on Ugly challenge.</td>', 'I think roads are ugly too.  Ugly on Ugly challenge.', '2008-03-13 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562886, 656442, 90806, '<td valign="top">Polluted but grainy and the left foliage seems a bit posterized.</td>', 'Polluted but grainy and the left foliage seems a bit posterized.', '2008-03-13 22:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562890, 656945, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photo, and my #1 pollution complaint that we could fix easy, but never will.</td>', 'This is a fantastic photo, and my #1 pollution complaint that we could fix easy, but never will.', '2008-03-13 22:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562891, 654974, 90806, '<td valign="top">I really like how there is sharpness to the foreground so that the fuzziness of the stacks is easily attributable to the haze and distance.  Excellent.</td>', 'I really like how there is sharpness to the foreground so that the fuzziness of the stacks is easily attributable to the haze and distance.  Excellent.', '2008-03-13 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562893, 655260, 30454, '<td valign="top">My Pick for ribbon. Very good lighting.</td>', 'My Pick for ribbon. Very good lighting.', '2008-03-13 22:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562895, 656812, 30454, '<td valign="top">My pick for ribbon. Nice concept. Plastic bags with Blue sky works great. Plastic bags is one of the biggest concern.</td>', 'My pick for ribbon. Nice concept. Plastic bags with Blue sky works great. Plastic bags is one of the biggest concern.', '2008-03-13 22:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562896, 655925, 90806, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a bit oversaturated making it look more like paint than thin film diffraction rainbows.  Beautiful colors, nice sharp image except for the top edge going out of focus.</td>', 'Colors seem a bit oversaturated making it look more like paint than thin film diffraction rainbows.  Beautiful colors, nice sharp image except for the top edge going out of focus.', '2008-03-13 22:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562897, 656760, 30454, '<td valign="top">Good one. This one should end up in top 10. Color tone is nice, works well with the theme.</td>', 'Good one. This one should end up in top 10. Color tone is nice, works well with the theme.', '2008-03-13 22:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562898, 657115, 90806, '<td valign="top">Seems like there is a story in there...</td>', 'Seems like there is a story in there...', '2008-03-13 22:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562900, 657068, 30454, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Definitely portrays the urban living. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition. Definitely portrays the urban living. Good luck.', '2008-03-13 22:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562901, 655983, 59415, '<td valign="top">lol  that is gross.  good thing it goes away in a couple days...lol</td>', 'lol  that is gross.  good thing it goes away in a couple days...lol', '2008-03-13 22:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562902, 656405, 30454, '<td valign="top">I like this. Good long exposure here. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this. Good long exposure here. Good luck.', '2008-03-13 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562903, 657115, 59415, '<td valign="top">No way, that is just art.  See the garbage bags next to the extinguisher?  I am thinking that everything in this photo is exatly how it was ment to be.</td>', 'No way, that is just art.  See the garbage bags next to the extinguisher?  I am thinking that everything in this photo is exatly how it was ment to be.', '2008-03-13 22:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562904, 655933, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this.</td>', 'I like the composition of this.', '2008-03-13 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562905, 657067, 59415, '<td valign="top">I thought this might have been caused by a dirty diaper from whatever creature might have used that swing behind his head.</td>', 'I thought this might have been caused by a dirty diaper from whatever creature might have used that swing behind his head.', '2008-03-13 22:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562908, 657057, 30454, '<td valign="top">Definitely a WOW factor. Nice B&amp;W image here. Should finish up high. Good luck.</td>', 'Definitely a WOW factor. Nice B&W image here. Should finish up high. Good luck.', '2008-03-13 22:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562909, 655141, 90806, '<td valign="top">Brilliant fire and that smokes makes me not want to breath.  Not sure I like the border, but a beautiful shot of a stinky mess.</td>', 'Brilliant fire and that smokes makes me not want to breath.  Not sure I like the border, but a beautiful shot of a stinky mess.', '2008-03-13 22:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562915, 657039, 30454, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast and grainy image. Works for me. Good Luck.</td>', 'I like the high contrast and grainy image. Works for me. Good Luck.', '2008-03-13 22:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562917, 656760, 90806, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but don''t know about polluted from the pic.</td>', 'Pretty, but don''t know about polluted from the pic.', '2008-03-13 22:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
