(4562925, 655424, 30454, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, goes very well with the challenge. Lighting is little flat. I would have used curves or contrast to add depth.</td>', 'Nice shot, goes very well with the challenge. Lighting is little flat. I would have used curves or contrast to add depth.', '2008-03-13 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
