(4562955, 656755, 31535, '<td valign="top">You got really good light on the smoke, but im not fond of the directional shadows on your face. Also, a quick horizontal flip would cause your logo''s to look right.</td>', 'You got really good light on the smoke, but im not fond of the directional shadows on your face. Also, a quick horizontal flip would cause your logo''s to look right.', '2008-03-13 23:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563045, 657015, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very lovely landscape. At first I was going to say that this image didn''t convey enough of a "pollution" message, but now that I look at the title and realise that the source of the beautiful reflection is a cesspool of sewage waste, I really think it hits the nail on the head. You presented an ugly subject in a beautiful way. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very lovely landscape. At first I was going to say that this image didn''t convey enough of a "pollution" message, but now that I look at the title and realise that the source of the beautiful reflection is a cesspool of sewage waste, I really think it hits the nail on the head. You presented an ugly subject in a beautiful way. Nicely done.', '2008-03-14 00:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563069, 657133, 90380, '<td valign="top">The way you darkened the buildings, even though a lot of detail is lost, is very effective in portraying a dingy, dirty feel. Also the slightly warmish tone was a good choice as brown-ish has a dirtier feel than neutral or bluey-grey.</td>', 'The way you darkened the buildings, even though a lot of detail is lost, is very effective in portraying a dingy, dirty feel. Also the slightly warmish tone was a good choice as brown-ish has a dirtier feel than neutral or bluey-grey.', '2008-03-14 00:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563074, 656886, 90380, '<td valign="top">An interesting new angle on a sight that is seen so often in more flattering circumstances. The unfortunate thing about this image is that it looks like the quality has been severely degraded in processing.</td>', 'An interesting new angle on a sight that is seen so often in more flattering circumstances. The unfortunate thing about this image is that it looks like the quality has been severely degraded in processing.', '2008-03-14 00:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563080, 655963, 90380, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title at all, but I guess that smoke in dance clubs could be considered pollution.. I like how the green light has created interesting lines, but I wish either that the visible dancer was a bit clearer, or that I could see more of the people, but that is just a matter of taste.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title at all, but I guess that smoke in dance clubs could be considered pollution.. I like how the green light has created interesting lines, but I wish either that the visible dancer was a bit clearer, or that I could see more of the people, but that is just a matter of taste.', '2008-03-14 00:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563082, 655484, 90380, '<td valign="top">I think this would look more appealing if 1) the dof included the thumb, and 2) the lighting was not quite so harsh. I do appreciate the pollution reference though.</td>', 'I think this would look more appealing if 1) the dof included the thumb, and 2) the lighting was not quite so harsh. I do appreciate the pollution reference though.', '2008-03-14 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563088, 656274, 90380, '<td valign="top">The image of a dead bird is not especially appealing to me, but it is a powerful message about pollution. That said, I wish that you had removed the stick on the right and the rock in the lower left. That stick is really distracting. Also if you had tried some different angles (not that you didn''t), you may have found a more interesting composition besides dead centre (no pun;). The way the bird''s head is tucked under its wing creates some extra emotional impact IMO.</td>', 'The image of a dead bird is not especially appealing to me, but it is a powerful message about pollution. That said, I wish that you had removed the stick on the right and the rock in the lower left. That stick is really distracting. Also if you had tried some different angles (not that you didn''t), you may have found a more interesting composition besides dead centre (no pun;). The way the bird''s head is tucked under its wing creates some extra emotional impact IMO.', '2008-03-14 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563090, 657066, 90380, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Looks so science-fictiony. I love how the top and bottom are light and frame the dark subject.</td>', 'Excellent. Looks so science-fictiony. I love how the top and bottom are light and frame the dark subject.', '2008-03-14 01:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563093, 655609, 90380, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours. I love that too-smooth surreal effect.</td>', 'Beautiful colours. I love that too-smooth surreal effect.', '2008-03-14 01:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563096, 655260, 90380, '<td valign="top">Cool. The smoke reminds me of the big ghost from "Poltergeist". Good job blocking out all the surrounding light.</td>', 'Cool. The smoke reminds me of the big ghost from "Poltergeist". Good job blocking out all the surrounding light.', '2008-03-14 01:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563098, 656405, 91082, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, but the pollution is almost secondary to the composition.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, but the pollution is almost secondary to the composition.', '2008-03-14 01:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563099, 657026, 90380, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the scale is difficult to see until you see that semi in the middle. The compression of the scene gives it a surreal feel. Also the combination of warm and cool colours is eye-catching. Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting how the scale is difficult to see until you see that semi in the middle. The compression of the scene gives it a surreal feel. Also the combination of warm and cool colours is eye-catching. Nice job.', '2008-03-14 01:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563100, 657099, 91082, '<td valign="top">This picture is very one-dimensional.  It''s a picture.  Of trash.</td>', 'This picture is very one-dimensional.  It''s a picture.  Of trash.', '2008-03-14 01:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563101, 655983, 90380, '<td valign="top">Eeeew... I agree though.</td>', 'Eeeew... I agree though.', '2008-03-14 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
