(4563134, 656988, 31535, '<td valign="top">LOL. I had the same idea but didn''t have time to enter. Lighting on your model seems good, but the lighting on the speaker doesn''t. It''s to bright on the far right. I really like the black backround as the hair really stands out in it.</td>', 'LOL. I had the same idea but didn''t have time to enter. Lighting on your model seems good, but the lighting on the speaker doesn''t. It''s to bright on the far right. I really like the black backround as the hair really stands out in it.', '2008-03-14 01:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
