(4563139, 655484, 31535, '<td valign="top">Lighting is not very good and the focus is off. Try to avoid direct lighting as it causes hot spots. I also would have liked to see the Disaronno label in the shot.</td>', 'Lighting is not very good and the focus is off. Try to avoid direct lighting as it causes hot spots. I also would have liked to see the Disaronno label in the shot.', '2008-03-14 01:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
