(4563148, 656945, 31535, '<td valign="top">Good night shot. I think seeing more of the water and less of the sky would have been better. The light reflecting in the water seems more interesting than the sky.</td>', 'Good night shot. I think seeing more of the water and less of the sky would have been better. The light reflecting in the water seems more interesting than the sky.', '2008-03-14 01:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
