(4563564, 656347, 89429, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Would be better blown up and with a bit more light.  Love the angle.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Would be better blown up and with a bit more light.  Love the angle.', '2008-03-14 09:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563568, 656199, 89423, '<td valign="top">ick...it looks like a mini person then a bird came to eat it</td>', 'ick...it looks like a mini person then a bird came to eat it', '2008-03-14 09:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563570, 655703, 51538, '<td valign="top">Hackney... oh for old London.  I like this local view.</td>', 'Hackney... oh for old London.  I like this local view.', '2008-03-14 09:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563571, 655678, 89429, '<td valign="top">Incredible.  This really is the perfect picture from a technical standpoint; my eyes can''t stop moving all over it to take in everything it has to offer.  Excellent photo.</td>', 'Incredible.  This really is the perfect picture from a technical standpoint; my eyes can''t stop moving all over it to take in everything it has to offer.  Excellent photo.', '2008-03-14 09:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563573, 656699, 89429, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and concept.  Maybe bring the bear in a bit closer to get it in focus.</td>', 'Nice composition and concept.  Maybe bring the bear in a bit closer to get it in focus.', '2008-03-14 09:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563574, 656216, 89429, '<td valign="top">Nice angle; I like how it influenced the tone of the photo.</td>', 'Nice angle; I like how it influenced the tone of the photo.', '2008-03-14 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563577, 656987, 89423, '<td valign="top">Pretty, I like the smoke, it makes for an elegent photograph</td>', 'Pretty, I like the smoke, it makes for an elegent photograph', '2008-03-14 09:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563583, 655424, 89431, '<td valign="top">OMG, I don''t know where this is but man did it give you a great shot covered in pollution, even the sky looks smoggy. Other than that great range of values And the gritty textures give a sense being there. Love the expression (obviously not faked) everything here seems all to real.</td>', 'OMG, I don''t know where this is but man did it give you a great shot covered in pollution, even the sky looks smoggy. Other than that great range of values And the gritty textures give a sense being there. Love the expression (obviously not faked) everything here seems all to real.', '2008-03-14 09:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563584, 657027, 89431, '<td valign="top">Great shot the yellow fog really gives a polluted feeling and adds to the refinery. The misty discolored sky is also a great element in your photo. The border, which usually distracts and bothers me, didn''t even get noticed until after i had taken in the whole photograph. This is exactly what i pictured in my head when i thought of pollution so i want to say in advanced, congrats on the ribbon! (if you dont get one you''ve been cheated!)</td>', 'Great shot the yellow fog really gives a polluted feeling and adds to the refinery. The misty discolored sky is also a great element in your photo. The border, which usually distracts and bothers me, didn''t even get noticed until after i had taken in the whole photograph. This is exactly what i pictured in my head when i thought of pollution so i want to say in advanced, congrats on the ribbon! (if you dont get one you''ve been cheated!)', '2008-03-14 09:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563585, 657122, 89431, '<td valign="top">Clever photograph it is the most creative i have seen in this challenge. I like your use of negative space and the texture on the cig. looks so crumbly and nasty compared to the fluffy clouds so besides the contrasting textures the colors biege and blue seem to complement eachother so everything seems to be working in your favor.</td>', 'Clever photograph it is the most creative i have seen in this challenge. I like your use of negative space and the texture on the cig. looks so crumbly and nasty compared to the fluffy clouds so besides the contrasting textures the colors biege and blue seem to complement eachother so everything seems to be working in your favor.', '2008-03-14 09:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
