(4563588, 656909, 89431, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast and range of values. I like the composition and use of space as well. The cropping was done really well and on top of all that a good message too. Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful contrast and range of values. I like the composition and use of space as well. The cropping was done really well and on top of all that a good message too. Well done!', '2008-03-14 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
