(4563675, 655340, 90892, '<td valign="top">Looks like you used a flash. It was a little too harsh. The hot spots on the bottle are distracting and burn out some of the lettering.  Looks like the bottle is on top of two sheets of paper that are lying on top of one another (The bottle was too big for just one sheet I suppose) There is  very distracting line running across the photo that indicates this. The neck of the bottle loses focus as their is not enough depth of field.  Nice Idea. Just needs a little work. Maybe if the bottle were sitting up it would help also. How bout some shot glasses? alot you could do with this idea. I think a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like you used a flash. It was a little too harsh. The hot spots on the bottle are distracting and burn out some of the lettering.  Looks like the bottle is on top of two sheets of paper that are lying on top of one another (The bottle was too big for just one sheet I suppose) There is  very distracting line running across the photo that indicates this. The neck of the bottle loses focus as their is not enough depth of field.  Nice Idea. Just needs a little work. Maybe if the bottle were sitting up it would help also. How bout some shot glasses? alot you could do with this idea. I think a good take on the challenge.', '2008-03-14 10:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
