(4563716, 657034, 90892, '<td valign="top">I think if the sky were blue instead of the same color as the pollution this would be a 10. Still this is an excellent shot with much to commend it. Nice juxtaposition of ''clean'' suburban life with the pollution.  This one really makes you think.  I can''t quit thinking about who might live in these homes and how they feel about what''s in their backyard. Having the edges of the two closest houses on either side almost makes it feel like the houses have circled up in a defensive posture against the pollution.</td>', 'I think if the sky were blue instead of the same color as the pollution this would be a 10. Still this is an excellent shot with much to commend it. Nice juxtaposition of ''clean'' suburban life with the pollution.  This one really makes you think.  I can''t quit thinking about who might live in these homes and how they feel about what''s in their backyard. Having the edges of the two closest houses on either side almost makes it feel like the houses have circled up in a defensive posture against the pollution.', '2008-03-14 10:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
