(4564195, 656812, 74273, '<td valign="top">I work for a group trying to get rid of plastic bags :) Nice job in subject matter and title!! :)</td>', 'I work for a group trying to get rid of plastic bags :) Nice job in subject matter and title!! :)', '2008-03-14 16:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564197, 655098, 74273, '<td valign="top">nice shot. It doesn''t look too polluted there :)...but even so, this is a really beautiful shot.</td>', 'nice shot. It doesn''t look too polluted there :)...but even so, this is a really beautiful shot.', '2008-03-14 16:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564198, 656957, 26001, '<td valign="top">this photo has a high technical merit (cannot think of anything wrong with dof, exposure, composition) but does not hold viewers'' attention for long, which makes it a 5 photo for me. some sort of interest in the background could have helped the photograph.</td>', 'this photo has a high technical merit (cannot think of anything wrong with dof, exposure, composition) but does not hold viewers'' attention for long, which makes it a 5 photo for me. some sort of interest in the background could have helped the photograph.', '2008-03-14 16:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564202, 655609, 26001, '<td valign="top">what a nice riot of saturated colors! nice choice of exposure to get the beautiful "star" effect on the lights. i like the smoothness of the background too.</td>', 'what a nice riot of saturated colors! nice choice of exposure to get the beautiful "star" effect on the lights. i like the smoothness of the background too.', '2008-03-14 16:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564203, 655925, 26001, '<td valign="top">nice attempt at an abstract shot. i find it a little on the darker (brightness wise, not mood wise) though. i like the idea over all.</td>', 'nice attempt at an abstract shot. i find it a little on the darker (brightness wise, not mood wise) though. i like the idea over all.', '2008-03-14 16:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564209, 656816, 26001, '<td valign="top">excellent job capturing the "translucent" smoke. addition of reflection was a very good touch. why did not you try increasing the saturation? did you want to keep the mood of the photo a bit rough/dirty, instead of pretty, to fit the theme more appropriately?</td>', 'excellent job capturing the "translucent" smoke. addition of reflection was a very good touch. why did not you try increasing the saturation? did you want to keep the mood of the photo a bit rough/dirty, instead of pretty, to fit the theme more appropriately?', '2008-03-14 16:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564211, 656219, 26001, '<td valign="top">there are so many details to look at in this landscape. you did not only captured the smoke well but also included the fog on the water exceptionally well. Reminds me of the ocean on the planet Solaris, from the original/old "Solaris" movie.</td>', 'there are so many details to look at in this landscape. you did not only captured the smoke well but also included the fog on the water exceptionally well. Reminds me of the ocean on the planet Solaris, from the original/old "Solaris" movie.', '2008-03-14 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564215, 657039, 26001, '<td valign="top">very appropriate choice of post processing (bw, high-key with grains). reminds me of the BW treatment in the movie "PI:Faith in chaos".</td>', 'very appropriate choice of post processing (bw, high-key with grains). reminds me of the BW treatment in the movie "PI:Faith in chaos".', '2008-03-14 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564248, 656098, 26001, '<td valign="top">i like the documentary feel of this shot. not sure about the overall color cast though. the mask, bunny, girl with pink clothes, rail road with crossing sign, ugly telephone/light wires, and last but not the least factory.  every single element adds a meaning/interest in the image. brilliantly planned and composed.</td>', 'i like the documentary feel of this shot. not sure about the overall color cast though. the mask, bunny, girl with pink clothes, rail road with crossing sign, ugly telephone/light wires, and last but not the least factory.  every single element adds a meaning/interest in the image. brilliantly planned and composed.', '2008-03-14 16:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564263, 657057, 26001, '<td valign="top">exposure wise, this is just a bit on the darker side for my taste but has excellent tones and engaging composition. btw like the title too. good work.</td>', 'exposure wise, this is just a bit on the darker side for my taste but has excellent tones and engaging composition. btw like the title too. good work.', '2008-03-14 16:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564266, 655424, 53147, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot. The fact that this is reality for so many people is frightening.  I hope this stands out strong in placement. Scenes like these need to be seen. Bumping up.</td>', 'Powerful shot. The fact that this is reality for so many people is frightening.  I hope this stands out strong in placement. Scenes like these need to be seen. Bumping up.', '2008-03-14 16:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564332, 656909, 90626, '<td valign="top">gross....but oh so true.</td>', 'gross....but oh so true.', '2008-03-14 17:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4564423, 655678, 22459, '<td valign="top">Love the foreground in this high impact shot. To me the image is let down in the background because of it being so dark it is hard to make out the smoke and chimney as well as what appears to be compression artifacts around the crane and other structures.</td>', 'Love the foreground in this high impact shot. To me the image is let down in the background because of it being so dark it is hard to make out the smoke and chimney as well as what appears to be compression artifacts around the crane and other structures.', '2008-03-14 19:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
