(4565211, 657067, 5364, '<td valign="top">I feel you could have gone with a more moody lighting, and considered what would be in the background</td>', 'I feel you could have gone with a more moody lighting, and considered what would be in the background', '2008-03-15 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565218, 656959, 5364, '<td valign="top">Wrong symbol for acid! but very good never-the-less.</td>', 'Wrong symbol for acid! but very good never-the-less.', '2008-03-15 12:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565269, 657040, 90380, '<td valign="top">I think this is nicely composed and the details in the can are good. That gull on the left is so cute too! The only problem is that the front bird is overexposed and blown out pretty badly. I think the whole thing could be brought down a notch -- I much prefer a little underexposure if it prevents blown out highlights, especially in an important part of the photo.</td>', 'I think this is nicely composed and the details in the can are good. That gull on the left is so cute too! The only problem is that the front bird is overexposed and blown out pretty badly. I think the whole thing could be brought down a notch -- I much prefer a little underexposure if it prevents blown out highlights, especially in an important part of the photo.', '2008-03-15 13:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565278, 657099, 90380, '<td valign="top">At least it''s nice to see that people are using the garbage can rather than the trail! Probably was knocked over by some wildlife.. those filthy animals! ;-)<br/>About the photo, I think your coposition is well-done, but I''m not sure the black and white treatment adds anything to it. Whatever you used to desaturate it kinda flatteneds everything out. It needs some contrast or channel-mixing or something to give it some depth (I am not that experienced with b&amp;w processing, so I''m not sure really what tools are the best). That said, I think it would have been nice to try it in colour as well.</td>', 'At least it''s nice to see that people are using the garbage can rather than the trail! Probably was knocked over by some wildlife.. those filthy animals! ;-)About the photo, I think your coposition is well-done, but I''m not sure the black and white treatment adds anything to it. Whatever you used to desaturate it kinda flatteneds everything out. It needs some contrast or channel-mixing or something to give it some depth (I am not that experienced with b&w processing, so I''m not sure really what tools are the best). That said, I think it would have been nice to try it in colour as well.', '2008-03-15 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565281, 656551, 90380, '<td valign="top">This would be a great anti-smoking ad! Everything is great and really puts the message across well. The only thing I wish is that the cigarette wasn''t so blown out.</td>', 'This would be a great anti-smoking ad! Everything is great and really puts the message across well. The only thing I wish is that the cigarette wasn''t so blown out.', '2008-03-15 13:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565287, 655320, 90380, '<td valign="top">Good message -- gotta love positive pollution. As for the composition, I think it would look better with a good portion of the top cropped off, and I''d like to see more of the brick wall on the right.</td>', 'Good message -- gotta love positive pollution. As for the composition, I think it would look better with a good portion of the top cropped off, and I''d like to see more of the brick wall on the right.', '2008-03-15 13:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565293, 654868, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and detail in the roof, and I like how deadly horizontal the line a the bottom is. I think the puff of smoke looks too much like a cloud though, to really come across as pollution. If it was more on the darker grey side it would appear more dirty. Also, since the smoke is supposed to be the subject, I think it should be in focus. Overall, the composition is nice though.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and detail in the roof, and I like how deadly horizontal the line a the bottom is. I think the puff of smoke looks too much like a cloud though, to really come across as pollution. If it was more on the darker grey side it would appear more dirty. Also, since the smoke is supposed to be the subject, I think it should be in focus. Overall, the composition is nice though.', '2008-03-15 13:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565299, 657122, 90380, '<td valign="top">Cool. Such an interesting POV. Did you try any with the clouds in focus as well (or is that even possible??). I really wish that cloud at the top right wasn''t there, as it keeps stealing my attention.</td>', 'Cool. Such an interesting POV. Did you try any with the clouds in focus as well (or is that even possible??). I really wish that cloud at the top right wasn''t there, as it keeps stealing my attention.', '2008-03-15 13:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565304, 657041, 90380, '<td valign="top">I think the forground is a liiittle too dark. I believe your subject is that tire, but there is not enough attention being drawn to it. Still a nice picture though.</td>', 'I think the forground is a liiittle too dark. I believe your subject is that tire, but there is not enough attention being drawn to it. Still a nice picture though.', '2008-03-15 13:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565311, 657129, 31535, '<td valign="top">I like the blue colour in the towers and the sky behind but find it a little underexposed.</td>', 'I like the blue colour in the towers and the sky behind but find it a little underexposed.', '2008-03-15 13:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565316, 657093, 31535, '<td valign="top">This is an image that screams toxic. Well done. I like how you''ve exposed it to create a silhouette.</td>', 'This is an image that screams toxic. Well done. I like how you''ve exposed it to create a silhouette.', '2008-03-15 13:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565322, 657055, 31535, '<td valign="top">The photo is nice. The lighting on the beercan is too bright though as it blows out some of the colour. More lighting on the rest of things might bring the can and the scene closer together.</td>', 'The photo is nice. The lighting on the beercan is too bright though as it blows out some of the colour. More lighting on the rest of things might bring the can and the scene closer together.', '2008-03-15 14:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565324, 656981, 90380, '<td valign="top">As a stand-alone image it is beautiful. But, since your subject is supposed to be the pollution (which I assume is that haze way in the back hovering over the horizon), I think I might like to see this as a panarama, with most of the sky cropped off. The beautiful colours in the mountains do more than enough to keep it interesting. With those bright and interesting clouds, your message is just buried. All that aside, watch your horizons. Crooked ones are rather disturbing, and I bet you''re getting a lot of comments about it, unfortunately.</td>', 'As a stand-alone image it is beautiful. But, since your subject is supposed to be the pollution (which I assume is that haze way in the back hovering over the horizon), I think I might like to see this as a panarama, with most of the sky cropped off. The beautiful colours in the mountains do more than enough to keep it interesting. With those bright and interesting clouds, your message is just buried. All that aside, watch your horizons. Crooked ones are rather disturbing, and I bet you''re getting a lot of comments about it, unfortunately.', '2008-03-15 14:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565328, 657039, 31535, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an old movie. There''s quite a bit of noise in your photo though. Maybe that done on purpose, but it''s not to my taste.</td>', 'Reminds me of an old movie. There''s quite a bit of noise in your photo though. Maybe that done on purpose, but it''s not to my taste.', '2008-03-15 14:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565332, 657070, 31535, '<td valign="top">Love the blue sky. The birds are a perfect tie in to the scene.</td>', 'Love the blue sky. The birds are a perfect tie in to the scene.', '2008-03-15 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565333, 657027, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great tones with a touch of red. I like it. Also, the fog gives it a really eerie feeling.</td>', 'Great tones with a touch of red. I like it. Also, the fog gives it a really eerie feeling.', '2008-03-15 14:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565335, 656699, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. If this is the result of some kind of disaster though, it is kind of hard to see since the bg is so out of focus. Being of more of a documentary nature (if that is in fact your intention?), I think it should have a much larger dof.</td>', 'Very nice composition. If this is the result of some kind of disaster though, it is kind of hard to see since the bg is so out of focus. Being of more of a documentary nature (if that is in fact your intention?), I think it should have a much larger dof.', '2008-03-15 14:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565337, 656223, 31535, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t have cropped out the boat in the upper left.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t have cropped out the boat in the upper left.', '2008-03-15 14:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565342, 656098, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, exposed, and processed. That said, it looks kind of weird that the girl is wearing only a mask. Isn''t the purpose of the mask defeated if it is not sealed and the rest of the body isn''t protected?</td>', 'Very nicely composed, exposed, and processed. That said, it looks kind of weird that the girl is wearing only a mask. Isn''t the purpose of the mask defeated if it is not sealed and the rest of the body isn''t protected?', '2008-03-15 14:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565350, 656991, 31535, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field and perspective. Because of the size though, alot of the details are lost. Your scores will suffer if you don''t use the the largest submition size possible which is 640 pixels in basic editing.</td>', 'Good depth of field and perspective. Because of the size though, alot of the details are lost. Your scores will suffer if you don''t use the the largest submition size possible which is 640 pixels in basic editing.', '2008-03-15 14:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565352, 656987, 90380, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda like aaaaaa... I guess that''s the idea? lol</td>', 'Looks kinda like aaaaaa... I guess that''s the idea? lol', '2008-03-15 14:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565354, 657129, 90380, '<td valign="top">This would be lovely if only it was in focus.</td>', 'This would be lovely if only it was in focus.', '2008-03-15 14:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565359, 655312, 90380, '<td valign="top">lol. I like the different take on it. In most pictures we are made to abhor the pollution, but in this one we are feeling sorry for it! Nice dof by the way. Good detail too.</td>', 'lol. I like the different take on it. In most pictures we are made to abhor the pollution, but in this one we are feeling sorry for it! Nice dof by the way. Good detail too.', '2008-03-15 14:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565362, 656989, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Must have been challenging to get the little guy to stay still. Great dof, though I maaay have chosen to get the butt in focus as well. The butt''s a little blown out, but it''s not the first thing I notice.</td>', 'Nice capture! Must have been challenging to get the little guy to stay still. Great dof, though I maaay have chosen to get the butt in focus as well. The butt''s a little blown out, but it''s not the first thing I notice.', '2008-03-15 14:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565367, 656945, 90380, '<td valign="top">Wooooow... Awesome.</td>', 'Wooooow... Awesome.', '2008-03-15 14:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565387, 656111, 90380, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t necessarily say the powerlines are ugly, if that is what you are referring to. I think they add a lot of interest to the photo, but I get what you''re saying.  Very nicely done by the way, the colours are great.</td>', 'I wouldn''t necessarily say the powerlines are ugly, if that is what you are referring to. I think they add a lot of interest to the photo, but I get what you''re saying.  Very nicely done by the way, the colours are great.', '2008-03-15 14:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565394, 657055, 90380, '<td valign="top">Lucky how the sun lit up just the duck and the can. Almost a perfect moment.</td>', 'Lucky how the sun lit up just the duck and the can. Almost a perfect moment.', '2008-03-15 14:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565399, 656654, 90380, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but it looks either out of focus or like a bit of motion blur..?</td>', 'Beautiful, but it looks either out of focus or like a bit of motion blur..?', '2008-03-15 14:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565404, 656812, 90380, '<td valign="top">LOL. Flashback from American Beauty. There really IS so much beauty in a bag! Nicely done.</td>', 'LOL. Flashback from American Beauty. There really IS so much beauty in a bag! Nicely done.', '2008-03-15 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565411, 656295, 76676, '<td valign="top">Very nice! So far it my Fav!</td>', 'Very nice! So far it my Fav!', '2008-03-15 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565623, 656755, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good photo.....but don''t you know that smoke is bad for your camera equipment?!</td>', 'Good photo.....but don''t you know that smoke is bad for your camera equipment?!', '2008-03-15 16:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565627, 655925, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beauty in pollution, good photo</td>', 'Beauty in pollution, good photo', '2008-03-15 16:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565679, 656467, 26001, '<td valign="top">nice idea and equally well executed. good to see something "different". i have to admit that i do not like the oddly cropped can. if you just wanted to include the starting point of the spray, diagonal composition could have been better. i mean, the point of origin of the spray in any bottom corner with spray going diagonally up. with pure background like this, rotation wouldn''t have been difficult. i like this nonetheless.</td>', 'nice idea and equally well executed. good to see something "different". i have to admit that i do not like the oddly cropped can. if you just wanted to include the starting point of the spray, diagonal composition could have been better. i mean, the point of origin of the spray in any bottom corner with spray going diagonally up. with pure background like this, rotation wouldn''t have been difficult. i like this nonetheless.', '2008-03-15 17:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565697, 655424, 26001, '<td valign="top">the eye contact in the girl makes me VERY uncomfortable looking at the shot. a big success for a documentary/journalistic style photograph. similarity between lambs and two guys scrounging in the trash says a lot about their conditions. last bust not the least, those nice cars in the background shows the proof of financially extremely unbalanced society. one of the best shots i have seen in the documentary genre recently. <br/>will look forward to knowing more about this place and how you shot this photograph. thanks in advance.</td>', 'the eye contact in the girl makes me VERY uncomfortable looking at the shot. a big success for a documentary/journalistic style photograph. similarity between lambs and two guys scrounging in the trash says a lot about their conditions. last bust not the least, those nice cars in the background shows the proof of financially extremely unbalanced society. one of the best shots i have seen in the documentary genre recently. will look forward to knowing more about this place and how you shot this photograph. thanks in advance.', '2008-03-15 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565702, 657026, 26001, '<td valign="top">i like the post processing in this one. i would love to learn your technique (considering basic editing restriction without spot editing) where you can save those beautiful sunset colors in the sky and show all these details in the foreground. overall a nicely shot, composed, and processed photo.</td>', 'i like the post processing in this one. i would love to learn your technique (considering basic editing restriction without spot editing) where you can save those beautiful sunset colors in the sky and show all these details in the foreground. overall a nicely shot, composed, and processed photo.', '2008-03-15 17:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565706, 657040, 26001, '<td valign="top">what an excellent photo essay on water pollution! the softness and purity of white gull in contrast with ugly/dirty water, metal-can, and concrete-pillars. very nicely composed. i did not like the fact that the white-color on the bird is blown and has no details though.</td>', 'what an excellent photo essay on water pollution! the softness and purity of white gull in contrast with ugly/dirty water, metal-can, and concrete-pillars. very nicely composed. i did not like the fact that the white-color on the bird is blown and has no details though.', '2008-03-15 17:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565713, 657066, 26001, '<td valign="top">i like the idea and choice of your high-key post processing for it. although the dark colored coat, mask, trousers, and shoes just get lumped together in a big black blob. different shades of gray in clothing could have increased the impact of the shot a lot.</td>', 'i like the idea and choice of your high-key post processing for it. although the dark colored coat, mask, trousers, and shoes just get lumped together in a big black blob. different shades of gray in clothing could have increased the impact of the shot a lot.', '2008-03-15 17:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565719, 656987, 26001, '<td valign="top">it took me 2 seconds to actually make the connection between the title and the image. hahahhahaha very funny!!!</td>', 'it took me 2 seconds to actually make the connection between the title and the image. hahahhahaha very funny!!!', '2008-03-15 17:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565724, 655983, 89774, '<td valign="top">At least this will eventually wash away or decompose... pretty nasty stuff - can almost see what he had for lunch!</td>', 'At least this will eventually wash away or decompose... pretty nasty stuff - can almost see what he had for lunch!', '2008-03-15 17:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565727, 657067, 26001, '<td valign="top">the scary expressions in kid''s eyes are just brilliant. this kid has acting potential :)<br/>i did not like the choice of a night-shoot where it is not possible to see the details in the background. this could have been a 10 photo for me if it was shot in day light with high-key post-processing. i wouldn''t change a thing in composition and kid''s expressions though.</td>', 'the scary expressions in kid''s eyes are just brilliant. this kid has acting potential :)i did not like the choice of a night-shoot where it is not possible to see the details in the background. this could have been a 10 photo for me if it was shot in day light with high-key post-processing. i wouldn''t change a thing in composition and kid''s expressions though.', '2008-03-15 17:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4565821, 656111, 9462, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch for the challenge since this is a rather pristine scene BUT I will take it as the power lines are polluting your photograph ;)</td>', 'A bit of a stretch for the challenge since this is a rather pristine scene BUT I will take it as the power lines are polluting your photograph ;)', '2008-03-15 18:29:17.000000', NULL, 1);
