(4565924, 656883, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice moon shot har har. Can''t wait to see them drop like flies for lack of oxygen.<br/>This is a nice shot. Beautiful tones. Simple, and I love simplicity. One nitpick though, that halo was caused by your lens I think and it takes away from the image imo. But then again...<strike>8</strike> Nine!</td>', 'Nice moon shot har har. Can''t wait to see them drop like flies for lack of oxygen.This is a nice shot. Beautiful tones. Simple, and I love simplicity. One nitpick though, that halo was caused by your lens I think and it takes away from the image imo. But then again...8 Nine!', '2008-03-15 19:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
