(4567178, 656267, 90495, '<td valign="top">I understand your idea but i''m not seeing pollution here. I see a polluter but no pollution. A little, yes, but not enough to make an impact with this shot.</td>', 'I understand your idea but i''m not seeing pollution here. I see a polluter but no pollution. A little, yes, but not enough to make an impact with this shot.', '2008-03-16 10:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4567181, 656484, 90495, '<td valign="top">I like to see pollution in its natural colours. It''s a lot more disgusting that way. Your image shows us pollution very well but the tone is not helping to bring it out. Harsh ugly smoke looks more unappealing against a beautiful blue sky, it impacts the viewer more. jmo</td>', 'I like to see pollution in its natural colours. It''s a lot more disgusting that way. Your image shows us pollution very well but the tone is not helping to bring it out. Harsh ugly smoke looks more unappealing against a beautiful blue sky, it impacts the viewer more. jmo', '2008-03-16 10:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4567182, 656755, 90495, '<td valign="top">I agree, Canon is pollution. ;\<br/> <br/>Good clean shot of a disgusting habit that pollutes more than we think.</td>', 'I agree, Canon is pollution. ;\ Good clean shot of a disgusting habit that pollutes more than we think.', '2008-03-16 10:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
