(4567378, 656812, 327, '<td valign="top">Like the unusual perspective-good work.<br/>They are a curse on the earth! Here you always see a WalMart bag flying or stuck in the trees.</td>', 'Like the unusual perspective-good work.They are a curse on the earth! Here you always see a WalMart bag flying or stuck in the trees.', '2008-03-16 12:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4567405, 656862, 77250, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite image from the challenge.  Even though this isn''t a typical "pollution" it works well for the challenge.  The light is extremely menacing to the scene yet it adds a lot to the image and that shows the pollution aspect.  Its also an interesting building that is super streamlined and minimalistic which hints at no pollution, yet because of the challenge name it leaves some mystery to the building and suggests the fact that the building at hand may be hiding something bad.</td>', 'This is my favorite image from the challenge.  Even though this isn''t a typical "pollution" it works well for the challenge.  The light is extremely menacing to the scene yet it adds a lot to the image and that shows the pollution aspect.  Its also an interesting building that is super streamlined and minimalistic which hints at no pollution, yet because of the challenge name it leaves some mystery to the building and suggests the fact that the building at hand may be hiding something bad.', '2008-03-16 12:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4567412, 656886, 72068, '<td valign="top">Could do with being a bit sharper, perhaps some of the colours/contrast made more vibrant.</td>', 'Could do with being a bit sharper, perhaps some of the colours/contrast made more vibrant.', '2008-03-16 12:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
