(4567588, 657041, 89219, '<td valign="top">Normally I''d say this image looks a bit flat but I think the lack of pop gives it a more grubby polluted edge. <br/>My eye was drawn right to the sky rather than the foreground but short of cropping most the sky out I don''t know how this could have been avoided. Incidentally when I did that with my hands I found the picture more interesting.</td>', 'Normally I''d say this image looks a bit flat but I think the lack of pop gives it a more grubby polluted edge. My eye was drawn right to the sky rather than the foreground but short of cropping most the sky out I don''t know how this could have been avoided. Incidentally when I did that with my hands I found the picture more interesting.', '2008-03-16 14:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
