(4567865, 656812, 82985, '<td valign="top">I think this is very well done in a number of ways, and meets the challenge well.  I might play with the crop a bit, and might wish for a bit more space on the left side, but those are just tiny quibbles (is there even such a thing as a large quibble?)  9</td>', 'I think this is very well done in a number of ways, and meets the challenge well.  I might play with the crop a bit, and might wish for a bit more space on the left side, but those are just tiny quibbles (is there even such a thing as a large quibble?)  9', '2008-03-16 18:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4567869, 656068, 82985, '<td valign="top">very well done!  I would like to know exactly where this is, so I can avoid this intersection at all costs.  tricky subject matter to crop/compose.  I might like to see a bit more on the left side, and upper right corner, but hard to know.  If it is there in your original, it might be worth trying, and if the entire left turn arrow is available at the bottom, that might be fun to see, too.  Might still come right back to this framing, anyway, though.  9</td>', 'very well done!  I would like to know exactly where this is, so I can avoid this intersection at all costs.  tricky subject matter to crop/compose.  I might like to see a bit more on the left side, and upper right corner, but hard to know.  If it is there in your original, it might be worth trying, and if the entire left turn arrow is available at the bottom, that might be fun to see, too.  Might still come right back to this framing, anyway, though.  9', '2008-03-16 19:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4567873, 656862, 82985, '<td valign="top">Very well done, like the tonality and texture.  Luminous!  9</td>', 'Very well done, like the tonality and texture.  Luminous!  9', '2008-03-16 19:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
