(4568103, 655098, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great shadow on the sand.</td>', 'Great shadow on the sand.', '2008-03-16 21:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568113, 656402, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like abstracts, so this is interesting to me. An unfortunate light spot on the left side, but Basic prevented you from omitting that.</td>', 'I like abstracts, so this is interesting to me. An unfortunate light spot on the left side, but Basic prevented you from omitting that.', '2008-03-16 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568119, 656959, 62249, '<td valign="top">Creative! And well executed, too.</td>', 'Creative! And well executed, too.', '2008-03-16 21:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568129, 655459, 62249, '<td valign="top">Work on creating a more interesting composition. Your horizon is tilted, but not enough to look intentional. The sign post on the left is distracting. Because you''re shooting into the sun, we can''t see sufficient. shadow detail on the trash. Might''ve been better to shoot from the other side.</td>', 'Work on creating a more interesting composition. Your horizon is tilted, but not enough to look intentional. The sign post on the left is distracting. Because you''re shooting into the sun, we can''t see sufficient. shadow detail on the trash. Might''ve been better to shoot from the other side.', '2008-03-16 21:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568135, 656306, 62249, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate wire or cable in the lower left corner. Flash is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Unfortunate wire or cable in the lower left corner. Flash is a bit harsh.', '2008-03-16 21:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568138, 656496, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs straightening and a bit of work on the tonal range. But otherwise the composition is nice.</td>', 'Needs straightening and a bit of work on the tonal range. But otherwise the composition is nice.', '2008-03-16 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568140, 656274, 62249, '<td valign="top">Shadows are too harsh, and rock in foreground doesn''t add anything to the composition.</td>', 'Shadows are too harsh, and rock in foreground doesn''t add anything to the composition.', '2008-03-16 21:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568144, 657040, 62249, '<td valign="top">Blown out highlights on gull''s chest. Still, an interesting capture.</td>', 'Blown out highlights on gull''s chest. Still, an interesting capture.', '2008-03-16 21:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568145, 656561, 62249, '<td valign="top">Crop a little tighter to fill more of the frame. The left 20% of the frame doesn''t add much.</td>', 'Crop a little tighter to fill more of the frame. The left 20% of the frame doesn''t add much.', '2008-03-16 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568152, 655487, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this, and the red lighting adds interest. Overall composition, though, needs some work. Different placement of the telescope, and sharper focus on it, would help.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this, and the red lighting adds interest. Overall composition, though, needs some work. Different placement of the telescope, and sharper focus on it, would help.', '2008-03-16 21:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568154, 656467, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the green spray. Would like to see just a bit more of the can.</td>', 'Nice capture of the green spray. Would like to see just a bit more of the can.', '2008-03-16 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568157, 657057, 62249, '<td valign="top">This shot has good potential, given the nice composition and the birds juxtaposed with the industrial equipment, but the B/W conversion is too dark.</td>', 'This shot has good potential, given the nice composition and the birds juxtaposed with the industrial equipment, but the B/W conversion is too dark.', '2008-03-16 21:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568178, 656068, 62249, '<td valign="top">Well, congestion isn''t the same as pollution, but still a cool shot.</td>', 'Well, congestion isn''t the same as pollution, but still a cool shot.', '2008-03-16 21:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568195, 656886, 62249, '<td valign="top">This shot has potential, and the "Wig" idea is clever. Fiddle with the levels &amp; curves to show more shadow detail, and especially work on the way you save the shot for the web. It''s very pixelated, with lots of JPEG artifacts.</td>', 'This shot has potential, and the "Wig" idea is clever. Fiddle with the levels & curves to show more shadow detail, and especially work on the way you save the shot for the web. It''s very pixelated, with lots of JPEG artifacts.', '2008-03-16 21:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568209, 657034, 62249, '<td valign="top">Heh. Great editorial concept.</td>', 'Heh. Great editorial concept.', '2008-03-16 21:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568215, 656682, 62249, '<td valign="top">I know it''s hard to expose properly to get the black object to show enough detail, but the rest of the shot looks too washed out.</td>', 'I know it''s hard to expose properly to get the black object to show enough detail, but the rest of the shot looks too washed out.', '2008-03-16 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568240, 655387, 62249, '<td valign="top">Wow. This makes pollution look good.</td>', 'Wow. This makes pollution look good.', '2008-03-16 22:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568242, 657039, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the graininess, and B/W works well for this shot.</td>', 'I like the graininess, and B/W works well for this shot.', '2008-03-16 22:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568244, 655609, 62249, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. You''re gonna give pollution a good name.</td>', 'Gorgeous. You''re gonna give pollution a good name.', '2008-03-16 22:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568665, 656267, 31535, '<td valign="top">No real point of intrest.</td>', 'No real point of intrest.', '2008-03-17 02:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568667, 656810, 31535, '<td valign="top">Other than the title, I don''t see how it has to do with the challenge. It''s a nice shot with a great looking sky though.</td>', 'Other than the title, I don''t see how it has to do with the challenge. It''s a nice shot with a great looking sky though.', '2008-03-17 02:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568668, 656805, 31535, '<td valign="top">The background is blown out. Looks like it was taken in front of a window?? Try using a reflector to bounce some of the light better expose your products. It also need to be rotated.</td>', 'The background is blown out. Looks like it was taken in front of a window?? Try using a reflector to bounce some of the light better expose your products. It also need to be rotated.', '2008-03-17 02:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568669, 655963, 31535, '<td valign="top">Very different shot. I don''t see how it meets the challenge though.</td>', 'Very different shot. I don''t see how it meets the challenge though.', '2008-03-17 02:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568672, 656842, 31535, '<td valign="top">I like how the long exposure creates a flow in the smoke.</td>', 'I like how the long exposure creates a flow in the smoke.', '2008-03-17 02:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568673, 654974, 31535, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. My one gripe is that there is alot of noise.</td>', 'Simple and effective. My one gripe is that there is alot of noise.', '2008-03-17 02:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568677, 655751, 31535, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting it. Is he sweeping trash?</td>', 'I''m not getting it. Is he sweeping trash?', '2008-03-17 02:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568681, 657041, 31535, '<td valign="top">Seems a little underexpose which causes lost detail in the rocks. The tire stands out though which is the main focus of the shot.</td>', 'Seems a little underexpose which causes lost detail in the rocks. The tire stands out though which is the main focus of the shot.', '2008-03-17 02:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568684, 657099, 31535, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the sharpness of the tree as well as the high contrast.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the sharpness of the tree as well as the high contrast.', '2008-03-17 02:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568686, 655312, 31535, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. It''s simple and to the point. I think you should have cropped out the blue can(?) in the back. The wendy''s cup in the grass alone would be perfect.</td>', 'I really like this shot. It''s simple and to the point. I think you should have cropped out the blue can(?) in the back. The wendy''s cup in the grass alone would be perfect.', '2008-03-17 03:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568717, 656862, 89940, '<td valign="top">I love the stars and the green glow in the sky. In fact I like everything about this photo. If it were advanced editing I would probably reduce some the brightness on the end of the building but it''s a small thing. I am predicting you and I are competing for a ribbon in this challenge.</td>', 'I love the stars and the green glow in the sky. In fact I like everything about this photo. If it were advanced editing I would probably reduce some the brightness on the end of the building but it''s a small thing. I am predicting you and I are competing for a ribbon in this challenge.', '2008-03-17 03:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568763, 656772, 22459, '<td valign="top">Good blacka nd white image that shows pollution well.Not sure whats going on with the shirt?</td>', 'Good blacka nd white image that shows pollution well.Not sure whats going on with the shirt?', '2008-03-17 06:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568764, 655676, 22459, '<td valign="top">Not a nice place to live? The image does little for me not sure why, just not much appeal.</td>', 'Not a nice place to live? The image does little for me not sure why, just not much appeal.', '2008-03-17 06:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568765, 656216, 22459, '<td valign="top">Nice prespective and skyline, shows pollution well.</td>', 'Nice prespective and skyline, shows pollution well.', '2008-03-17 06:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568766, 655260, 22459, '<td valign="top">Cool image, works well for this challenge.</td>', 'Cool image, works well for this challenge.', '2008-03-17 06:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568768, 656551, 22459, '<td valign="top">Filthy stuff the old cancer sticks. Good graphic image with a message.</td>', 'Filthy stuff the old cancer sticks. Good graphic image with a message.', '2008-03-17 06:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568770, 655459, 22459, '<td valign="top">It shows pollution but not a lot of interest for me.</td>', 'It shows pollution but not a lot of interest for me.', '2008-03-17 06:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568771, 655933, 22459, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but could have been better with some nice soft lighting.</td>', 'I like the idea but could have been better with some nice soft lighting.', '2008-03-17 06:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568775, 656981, 87609, '<td valign="top">where is the city and where is the Pollution ? but nice photo!!!</td>', 'where is the city and where is the Pollution ? but nice photo!!!', '2008-03-17 06:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568778, 656909, 87609, '<td valign="top">Nice one , But  the fumes should be  more curled, here it  is like some artifact....</td>', 'Nice one , But  the fumes should be  more curled, here it  is like some artifact....', '2008-03-17 06:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
