(4569289, 657006, 43667, '<td valign="top">I laughed at the irony of this photo.  It displays a finest lack of pollution.  Oh the amazing things in Iceland.<br/> <br/>//iga.igg.cnr.it/geoworld/galleria/igaice2.gif</td>', 'I laughed at the irony of this photo.  It displays a finest lack of pollution.  Oh the amazing things in Iceland. //iga.igg.cnr.it/geoworld/galleria/igaice2.gif', '2008-03-17 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569294, 656068, 43667, '<td valign="top">Is this at an actual intersection or is it some kind of art piece?</td>', 'Is this at an actual intersection or is it some kind of art piece?', '2008-03-17 12:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569299, 656816, 43667, '<td valign="top">Oh Iceland...</td>', 'Oh Iceland...', '2008-03-17 12:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569309, 656959, 43667, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t that be radioactive rain?</td>', 'Shouldn''t that be radioactive rain?', '2008-03-17 12:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569312, 656295, 22459, '<td valign="top">The wide angle gives this image sooooo much appeal, looks great.</td>', 'The wide angle gives this image sooooo much appeal, looks great.', '2008-03-17 12:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569315, 656851, 22459, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I think you got a little to close, makes it hard to see what is what.</td>', 'Good idea but I think you got a little to close, makes it hard to see what is what.', '2008-03-17 12:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569318, 656699, 22459, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I think this would have worked better if the bear was torn or dirty, it looks too clean for a rubbish pile.</td>', 'Good idea but I think this would have worked better if the bear was torn or dirty, it looks too clean for a rubbish pile.', '2008-03-17 12:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569320, 656423, 22459, '<td valign="top">Classic pollution in more then one way. Good shot.</td>', 'Classic pollution in more then one way. Good shot.', '2008-03-17 12:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569323, 656988, 22459, '<td valign="top">Good graphic image and shows that pollution comes in many forms as the challenge description asked, well done.</td>', 'Good graphic image and shows that pollution comes in many forms as the challenge description asked, well done.', '2008-03-17 12:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569360, 656295, 88453, '<td valign="top">i don''t see the emissions</td>', 'i don''t see the emissions', '2008-03-17 12:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569399, 657026, 83313, '<td valign="top">Appropriately grungy. The treatment of this is a little overproccessed with a strong bluish cast, but I think it works well for the subject. I don''t think there is much in the way of eye leading composition on this, though.</td>', 'Appropriately grungy. The treatment of this is a little overproccessed with a strong bluish cast, but I think it works well for the subject. I don''t think there is much in the way of eye leading composition on this, though.', '2008-03-17 13:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569405, 657067, 83313, '<td valign="top">She looks a little crosseyed from wearing that thing. (That is a girl in there, right?) If not for the title, I would have missed the fact that it is a playground, as the background is so dark.</td>', 'She looks a little crosseyed from wearing that thing. (That is a girl in there, right?) If not for the title, I would have missed the fact that it is a playground, as the background is so dark.', '2008-03-17 13:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569407, 657015, 83313, '<td valign="top">An attempt to control pollution is a nice take on the subject. Nice colors and reflection, though I find the details of the facility are a little lost in the rest of the image. Perhaps a closer view of those main tanks on the left would have ore visual impact.</td>', 'An attempt to control pollution is a nice take on the subject. Nice colors and reflection, though I find the details of the facility are a little lost in the rest of the image. Perhaps a closer view of those main tanks on the left would have ore visual impact.', '2008-03-17 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569420, 656295, 83313, '<td valign="top">The city certainly has lots of pollution, but I really don''t see that illustrated here. My impression on seeing this image is not "pollution", but rather "nightlife". I feel it''s a shoehorn, however it is a really nice image. Good enough that, in spite of the shoehorn, it still gets a good vote from me.</td>', 'The city certainly has lots of pollution, but I really don''t see that illustrated here. My impression on seeing this image is not "pollution", but rather "nightlife". I feel it''s a shoehorn, however it is a really nice image. Good enough that, in spite of the shoehorn, it still gets a good vote from me.', '2008-03-17 13:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569424, 656654, 83313, '<td valign="top">I would not have thought this illustrated pollution without the title. Image is a little soft. Caused by the long exposure no doubt. The starry sky looks great!</td>', 'I would not have thought this illustrated pollution without the title. Image is a little soft. Caused by the long exposure no doubt. The starry sky looks great!', '2008-03-17 13:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4569432, 657049, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple and bold. I like the strong contrast of the green can on blue. Image size is a bit smaller than what you could have used for this challenge(640 pixels).</td>', 'Simple and bold. I like the strong contrast of the green can on blue. Image size is a bit smaller than what you could have used for this challenge(640 pixels).', '2008-03-17 13:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
