(4572287, 655340, 91496, '<td valign="top">Backgound is interesting and not a solid white.  Flash visable on the glass is distracting</td>', 'Backgound is interesting and not a solid white.  Flash visable on the glass is distracting', '2008-03-18 22:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572298, 656361, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but not sure it fits the category very well.  Maybe if the category was about smoke.  These re-enactors had more pollution from their cars than from the black powder used in the battle.</td>', 'I like the photo but not sure it fits the category very well.  Maybe if the category was about smoke.  These re-enactors had more pollution from their cars than from the black powder used in the battle.', '2008-03-18 22:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572301, 656573, 91496, '<td valign="top">Maybe cropping it portriat and using the right side would have made it more powerful.  The trees and road were not very interesting</td>', 'Maybe cropping it portriat and using the right side would have made it more powerful.  The trees and road were not very interesting', '2008-03-18 22:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572303, 657049, 91496, '<td valign="top">The blue is great.  Would a light blue or red can have looked better.</td>', 'The blue is great.  Would a light blue or red can have looked better.', '2008-03-18 22:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572304, 655963, 91496, '<td valign="top">Seem unrelated to pollution and abstract to boot.</td>', 'Seem unrelated to pollution and abstract to boot.', '2008-03-18 22:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572305, 656111, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but calling this pollution is a reach.</td>', 'Nice photo but calling this pollution is a reach.', '2008-03-18 22:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572307, 655983, 91496, '<td valign="top">Looks like sh$%.  Sorry I had to say it!<br/>Perhaps having a bigger depth of field would have helped.  Having the ground out of focus so close to the main object detracts from the photo.</td>', 'Looks like sh$%.  Sorry I had to say it!Perhaps having a bigger depth of field would have helped.  Having the ground out of focus so close to the main object detracts from the photo.', '2008-03-18 22:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572312, 655424, 91496, '<td valign="top">The many small pieces of litter tend to wash all the colors into a mess rather than allow the bright colors to stand out.  My eye was also drawn to the red store in the background which was not an intended focus of the photo</td>', 'The many small pieces of litter tend to wash all the colors into a mess rather than allow the bright colors to stand out.  My eye was also drawn to the red store in the background which was not an intended focus of the photo', '2008-03-18 22:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572316, 656223, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the image itself, color and texture are great. But the manner in which the pelican and pipe are apart from each other seems a little odd.</td>', 'I like the image itself, color and texture are great. But the manner in which the pelican and pipe are apart from each other seems a little odd.', '2008-03-18 22:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572321, 656125, 91496, '<td valign="top">More color and less slivery plastic would have made a better composition.</td>', 'More color and less slivery plastic would have made a better composition.', '2008-03-18 22:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572324, 656068, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''d seen a photo of this online before (In several places) and I always thought it was a photoshopped creation. Hope you can fill us in on where this is and why!</td>', 'I''d seen a photo of this online before (In several places) and I always thought it was a photoshopped creation. Hope you can fill us in on where this is and why!', '2008-03-18 22:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572327, 656886, 83313, '<td valign="top">An awful lot of JPEG compression showing here. Your image is only 13k when you could have used up to 150k. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor.</td>', 'An awful lot of JPEG compression showing here. Your image is only 13k when you could have used up to 150k. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor.', '2008-03-18 22:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572328, 656219, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nasty but lovely.</td>', 'Nasty but lovely.', '2008-03-18 22:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572341, 656805, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the dark and washed out colors did not work for me.</td>', 'Nice idea but the dark and washed out colors did not work for me.', '2008-03-18 22:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572343, 655484, 83313, '<td valign="top">A different take on the subject, but a valid one.</td>', 'A different take on the subject, but a valid one.', '2008-03-18 22:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572346, 656897, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think this one is a little bit of a stretch on the theme.</td>', 'I think this one is a little bit of a stretch on the theme.', '2008-03-18 22:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
