(4572349, 657000, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice gritty street photography.</td>', 'Nice gritty street photography.', '2008-03-18 22:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572353, 656442, 83313, '<td valign="top">a little grainy in the sky, but it leads the eye well and makes the point.</td>', 'a little grainy in the sky, but it leads the eye well and makes the point.', '2008-03-18 22:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572355, 657087, 83313, '<td valign="top">Could not agree more.</td>', 'Could not agree more.', '2008-03-18 22:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572359, 655260, 86334, '<td valign="top">Excellent smoke and excellent light.</td>', 'Excellent smoke and excellent light.', '2008-03-18 22:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572360, 657139, 86334, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing they didn''t invite you in, but the fence and power lines in the foreground take away from an otherwise excellent composure.</td>', 'I''m guessing they didn''t invite you in, but the fence and power lines in the foreground take away from an otherwise excellent composure.', '2008-03-18 22:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572362, 656125, 86334, '<td valign="top">The foreground sticks distract from your subject and hurt this image.</td>', 'The foreground sticks distract from your subject and hurt this image.', '2008-03-18 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572370, 656223, 86334, '<td valign="top">I like it but wish the top wasn''t cropped as close. Good job on catching the pre-landing wing flare!</td>', 'I like it but wish the top wasn''t cropped as close. Good job on catching the pre-landing wing flare!', '2008-03-18 22:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572372, 657129, 86334, '<td valign="top">A little dark and not sharp enough for my tastes.</td>', 'A little dark and not sharp enough for my tastes.', '2008-03-18 22:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572375, 656805, 86334, '<td valign="top">Strong backlight distracts and seems to cause some flare.</td>', 'Strong backlight distracts and seems to cause some flare.', '2008-03-18 22:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572382, 656484, 86334, '<td valign="top">Great subject. The monochrome really works. The foreground doesn''t help this otherwise great pic.</td>', 'Great subject. The monochrome really works. The foreground doesn''t help this otherwise great pic.', '2008-03-18 22:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572386, 656885, 86334, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but the OOF twig in the foreground grabs too much attention.</td>', 'I like the idea but the OOF twig in the foreground grabs too much attention.', '2008-03-18 22:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572388, 655141, 86334, '<td valign="top">Yikes! I hope you had a long lens... I like the saturated colors but the framing seems off. Too much lost on the left.</td>', 'Yikes! I hope you had a long lens... I like the saturated colors but the framing seems off. Too much lost on the left.', '2008-03-18 22:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572392, 655849, 86334, '<td valign="top">I like this composure with one exception. The #10 railroad ties are fighting with the yellow machine for my attention as the main subject.</td>', 'I like this composure with one exception. The #10 railroad ties are fighting with the yellow machine for my attention as the main subject.', '2008-03-18 22:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572394, 656493, 86334, '<td valign="top">I like it. Great composure.</td>', 'I like it. Great composure.', '2008-03-18 22:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572396, 656068, 86334, '<td valign="top">It''s too busy for my tastes but since that appears to be the message, well done.</td>', 'It''s too busy for my tastes but since that appears to be the message, well done.', '2008-03-18 22:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572399, 656551, 86334, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of textures on the smokers hand to help tell the story.</td>', 'Excellent use of textures on the smokers hand to help tell the story.', '2008-03-18 22:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572403, 655098, 86334, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2008-03-18 23:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572405, 656957, 86334, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF to focus attention on the pollution. But the tilt may be more distraction than help.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF to focus attention on the pollution. But the tilt may be more distraction than help.', '2008-03-18 23:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572411, 656810, 86334, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this one. Fewer items in the background would have helped keep attention on the fisherman.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this one. Fewer items in the background would have helped keep attention on the fisherman.', '2008-03-18 23:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572412, 655385, 86334, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how the simple images are sometimes the best. Well done.</td>', 'It''s funny how the simple images are sometimes the best. Well done.', '2008-03-18 23:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572419, 656264, 86334, '<td valign="top">Great color. Nice steam (or smoke). The cloud in the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'Great color. Nice steam (or smoke). The cloud in the background is a little distracting.', '2008-03-18 23:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572420, 655260, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great Image. Love the way the light brings out the smoke so much.</td>', 'Great Image. Love the way the light brings out the smoke so much.', '2008-03-18 23:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572421, 655387, 86334, '<td valign="top">Neat picture. Pretty spooky. It would have been nice to light the foreground stacks a little but I understand you may not have been given that option. Well done.</td>', 'Neat picture. Pretty spooky. It would have been nice to light the foreground stacks a little but I understand you may not have been given that option. Well done.', '2008-03-18 23:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572424, 657039, 86334, '<td valign="top">Retro feel to your image. The monochrome makes it!</td>', 'Retro feel to your image. The monochrome makes it!', '2008-03-18 23:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572426, 656573, 86334, '<td valign="top">Neat idea but the clutter on the left works against the message.</td>', 'Neat idea but the clutter on the left works against the message.', '2008-03-18 23:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572428, 656098, 31535, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this mask before. I like how you''ve tied the teddy bear in. I always find this type of border to look better in a landscape cropped photo rather than a square crop.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this mask before. I like how you''ve tied the teddy bear in. I always find this type of border to look better in a landscape cropped photo rather than a square crop.', '2008-03-18 23:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572430, 656405, 86334, '<td valign="top">I like the way the smoke works against the dark sky while the horizon is brighter still. The composition is a bit busy but the colors still make it a great image.</td>', 'I like the way the smoke works against the dark sky while the horizon is brighter still. The composition is a bit busy but the colors still make it a great image.', '2008-03-18 23:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572432, 655381, 86334, '<td valign="top">poor image quality. Having the main and tail rotors in frame would have helped  lot.</td>', 'poor image quality. Having the main and tail rotors in frame would have helped  lot.', '2008-03-18 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572433, 657026, 86334, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. I especially like the semi-silhouette of building and catwalks.</td>', 'This is a great image. I especially like the semi-silhouette of building and catwalks.', '2008-03-18 23:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572482, 656909, 90663, '<td valign="top">Not a bad effort, I''m wondering if the effect of the smoke would have been more striking if you shot the ashtray more edge-on, as it is it''s sort of lost in the background</td>', 'Not a bad effort, I''m wondering if the effect of the smoke would have been more striking if you shot the ashtray more edge-on, as it is it''s sort of lost in the background', '2008-03-18 23:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572489, 656405, 90663, '<td valign="top">I think I get what you were going for here, but this shot doesn''t say pollution that much to me</td>', 'I think I get what you were going for here, but this shot doesn''t say pollution that much to me', '2008-03-18 23:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
