(4572503, 655320, 90663, '<td valign="top">I think this might have had more impact if you pulled back just a little bit, show more of the wall</td>', 'I think this might have had more impact if you pulled back just a little bit, show more of the wall', '2008-03-18 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572507, 656493, 90663, '<td valign="top">Might be a little dust on your sensor, some dark dots on the sky background, I don''t get a big emotional impact from this one, composition isn''t bad though</td>', 'Might be a little dust on your sensor, some dark dots on the sky background, I don''t get a big emotional impact from this one, composition isn''t bad though', '2008-03-18 23:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572518, 655424, 90663, '<td valign="top">Those are some bad looking goats!  The person in the foreground IMO is pulling attention away from what should be the focus of your shot, still giving it a 7 though</td>', 'Those are some bad looking goats!  The person in the foreground IMO is pulling attention away from what should be the focus of your shot, still giving it a 7 though', '2008-03-18 23:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
