(4573056, 656883, 66823, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments everyone.<br/> <br/>I really wanted to nuke the double-sun - caused by taking the photo from behind a window (unfortunately we can''t open our office windows... but then looking outside - sometimes it''s not so unfortunate!) - but with the Basic Editing it was not allowed...<br/> <br/>To be fair to Beijing this is not an everyday occurrence... but it is more frequent than is comfortable.  There can be some beautiful days too.  I''m keeping my fingers crossed for everybody, that the Olympics turns out to be a good event for all.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments everyone. I really wanted to nuke the double-sun - caused by taking the photo from behind a window (unfortunately we can''t open our office windows... but then looking outside - sometimes it''s not so unfortunate!) - but with the Basic Editing it was not allowed... To be fair to Beijing this is not an everyday occurrence... but it is more frequent than is comfortable.  There can be some beautiful days too.  I''m keeping my fingers crossed for everybody, that the Olympics turns out to be a good event for all.', '2008-03-19 04:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
