(4574620, 657049, 63267, '<td valign="top">I am surprised this didnt'' score better.  It isn''t a perfect picture, but it has the elements that DPC seems to like.  Perhaps it was the title that did it in for you as too clicheish.  Overall though, I think it is a good photo that certainly did not deserve 4 1''s!</td>', 'I am surprised this didnt'' score better.  It isn''t a perfect picture, but it has the elements that DPC seems to like.  Perhaps it was the title that did it in for you as too clicheish.  Overall though, I think it is a good photo that certainly did not deserve 4 1''s!', '2008-03-19 16:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4575108, 655320, 89414, '<td valign="top">I''m new to the photography field so I do appreciate the advice.  Well, for those who lent some advice to the shot.  I don''t know who put the paint on the wall but I would consider that alone to be pollution.  I can see the need for more brick, that would have looked better I think.  Too much negative space at the top...yep I agree.  I submitted this picture so that I could get some helpful hints as to how to better myself in the field.  So again, for those of you who offered some constructive criticism I thank you.</td>', 'I''m new to the photography field so I do appreciate the advice.  Well, for those who lent some advice to the shot.  I don''t know who put the paint on the wall but I would consider that alone to be pollution.  I can see the need for more brick, that would have looked better I think.  Too much negative space at the top...yep I agree.  I submitted this picture so that I could get some helpful hints as to how to better myself in the field.  So again, for those of you who offered some constructive criticism I thank you.', '2008-03-19 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 0),
