(4575540, 657057, 74273, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments, everyone. I am really happy to be in the top 10! Unfortunately for those of you who thought it was a conversion...sorry...it''s the real deal: black and white with a polarizing filter. I just nudged the contrast up a couple notches afterwards.<br/> <br/>I also thought it was pretty interesting/ironic/sad to see an oil refinery sitting right on a California beach with all the wildlife around...</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments, everyone. I am really happy to be in the top 10! Unfortunately for those of you who thought it was a conversion...sorry...it''s the real deal: black and white with a polarizing filter. I just nudged the contrast up a couple notches afterwards. I also thought it was pretty interesting/ironic/sad to see an oil refinery sitting right on a California beach with all the wildlife around...', '2008-03-19 22:12:48.000000', NULL, 0),
