(4577738, 655609, 68035, '<td valign="top">What is it with you and the ability to take great photos of pollutants and ugly things maybe not quite up to <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=592990" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/738/120/592990.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/738/120/592990.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/738/120/592990.jpg"/></a> but still stunning<br/> <br/>Great effect from the 8 second exposure and I love the way the orange smoke almost bleeds into the dark blue sky (complimentary colours at their strangest but best)<br/> <br/></td>', 'What is it with you and the ability to take great photos of pollutants and ugly things maybe not quite up to  but still stunning Great effect from the 8 second exposure and I love the way the orange smoke almost bleeds into the dark blue sky (complimentary colours at their strangest but best) ', '2008-03-20 20:36:06.000000', NULL, 0),
